      "name": "the-padlock",
      "type": "registry:block",
      "title": "The Padlock",
      "description": "An isometric padlock in SVG. The shackle lifts clear of the two bores in the crown, swings open about its heel leg, and the keyway turns a quarter turn in the escutcheon; one number drives the lift, the swing and the turn. It runs its own tour with a play/pause control, and once paused you can scrub the lock or drive it with the arrow keys.",
      "categories": ["svg", "isometric", "interactive"],
